  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "金融資訊系統",
    "sub_ename": "FINANCIAL INFORMATION SYSTEM",
    "describe_ch": "本課程介紹財務資訊與數量分析的基本概念，培養學生運用Excel, VBA、R 與Python 等程式工具進行金融數據處理與分析的能力。課程內容包括：金融資訊系統基礎、金融資料庫簡介、程式設計訓練及金融數據分析實務等，透過理論與實作的結合，培養學生具備金融資訊的收集、處理與分析能力。",
    "describe_eh": "This course introduces the fundamentals of financial information and quantitative analysis, aiming to develop students’ ability to use programming tools such as Excel, VBA, R, and Python for financial data processing and analysis. The course covers basics of financial information systems, introduction to financial databases, programming skills, and practical financial data analysis. Through the integration of theory and hands-on practice, students will cultivate the ability to collect, process, and analyze financial information.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
